"Standard SRD 5.2.1: the class hit die, improvements and feats at the SRD "
"levels, and new spells when levelling up. No unique skills."

#: CampaignManager/templates/index.html:7
msgid ""
"El catálogo de reglas de Aegis, nuestra variante del SRD 5.2.1, y del SRD "
"5.2.1 estándar: lo que cargan los fixtures del SRD y nuestras armas caseras. "
"Cada campaña elige con cuál juega en su página de inicio."
msgstr ""
"The rules catalog of Aegis, our variant of the SRD 5.2.1, and of the standard"
" SRD 5.2.1: what the SRD fixtures and our homemade weapons load. Each "
"campaign chooses which one it plays with on its home page."

